	(text "every resistor drops the voltage 0.08v \ncan we even measure that with our adc on the pi?\n\nThe adc might need its own stabilized 3v3 as refernece voltage\n(or we just oversample every measurement a certain amount to just\nignore a unstable reference voltage)"
